% Exhaust all four valid vote combinations. The two mixed outcomes expose the
% coordinator bug at world 2; unanimous yes and unanimous no remain safe.
name atomic-commit-buggy
program commit-buggy.tpl
steps 4

assert 0 begin(tx1)

choose 1 p1_vote vote_yes(tx1, p1)
choose 1 p1_vote vote_no(tx1, p1)
choose 1 p2_vote vote_yes(tx1, p2)
choose 1 p2_vote vote_no(tx1, p2)

invariant atomic_decision forbids violation(atomic_decision, T)
